### ProxyAPI - HTTP Request Testing File
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension or Visual Studio
### Base URL - Update the port if needed
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ==============================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ==============================================

### 1. Register Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### 2. Register Normal User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "User123!",
  "role": "User"
}

### 3. Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 4. Login as Normal User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "User123!"
}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### USER MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ==============================================

### 6. Get All Users (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Update Own Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name"
}

### 8. Delete User by ID (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/user/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### PRODUCT ENDPOINTS (EF Core + Dapper Demo)
### ==============================================

### 9. Create Product (EF Core - Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "High-performance laptop for developers",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 50
}

### 10. Create Another Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse",
  "price": 29.99,
  "stock": 200
}

### 11. Get All Products (Dapper)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Product by ID (Dapper)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Search Products by Name (Dapper)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product/search?name=laptop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Update Product (EF Core - Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "description": "Ultimate gaming laptop with RTX 4090",
  "price": 2499.99,
  "stock": 25
}

### 15. Delete Product (Dapper - Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/product/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### DASHBOARD ENDPOINTS
### ==============================================

### 16. Get All Customers (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
